@title Help popups open: the ? in Standards check opens its text and it fits the window
@area Windows
@sizes 1366x768
open_starter_example
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Standards check
key enter
wait 10
# Standards check opens docked at the right edge: the ? next to "Ticked standards" opens the popup.
click 1180 149
wait 5
shot standards-popup-open
expect "Each standard you tick adds its findings"
check_layout
